# Infoscreen: track the CODE and the structural config (screens.conf) only. Everything a
# render regenerates, every rotating counter, all secrets, the personal curation, and the
# big externally-managed trees stay out.

# ---- personal curation: which games/feeds/clips YOU follow. Not part of the software,
#      and this repo is headed for a public GitHub one day. Tracked *.example.* twins
#      document the schema; copy one to the real name and edit it.
playlist.txt
screens/deals/watchlist.json
screens/releases/countdowns.json
screens/news/news_feeds.json

# ---- machine-local installation settings: which place this screen reports the weather for,
#      and the contact string the weather APIs are asked to identify this client by. Tracked
#      twin: location.example.json. contact.txt is optional -- without it the code sends the
#      project URL, which is all met.no requires.
location.json
contact.txt

# ---- resolved-id caches: derived from the watchlist, rebuild themselves on first fetch.
#      They exist to PIN a fuzzy title->game match, so keep the local copies, just don't
#      version them.
screens/deals/itad_ids.json
screens/deals/aks_ids.json

# ---- generated bitmaps: rewritten on every render ----
*.bgra
*.png
# ...except the README screenshots, which are generated too but have to be in the repo for
# GitHub to render them. tools/screenshot.py rebuilds them from example data.
!docs/screenshots/*.png

# ---- rotating runtime state ----
panel_mode.txt
dim_alpha.txt
temp_value.txt
notice_*.txt
*_page.txt
net_state.json

# ---- fetched caches (all regenerable from the APIs) ----
*cache*.json
fetch_state.json
slot_cache.json
pihole_sid.json
tasks_token.json
icon_cache/

# ---- append-only measured history: data, not code. NOT regenerable -- back these up
#      separately, but they churn every 30 s so git is the wrong home for them.
mpv_exits.log
screens/net/live.json
screens/net/samples.jsonl
screens/net/netlog.jsonl
screens/net/history.json

# ---- big / externally managed ----
media/
venv/

# ---- SECRETS: never commit ----
screens/cal/calendars.json
screens/cal/google_tasks_oauth.json
screens/deals/itad_api.json
screens/pihole/pihole_api.json

# ---- python ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- the old versioning mechanism, superseded by git ----
*bak*
